** Probe: a main run with EVENTFIL so that AERMOD writes the event deck
** itself (output.f EVEFIL / MXEVNT); RUNORNOT RUN over the first days of
** the fixture meteorology. The deck AERMOD wrote is vendored as probe 29b.
** AERMOD said: MX E580 at the end (the vendored AERMET2.SFC holds 96
** hours, STARTEND asks for ten days), but 29_events.inp is written with
** the four high-first-high events (one per averaging period and group),
** named H001H01001 and so on.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 29: main run with EVENTFIL so AERMOD writes the event deck
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT
   AVERTIME  1  24
   POLLUTID  SO2
   EVENTFIL  29_events.inp  SOCONT
   RUNORNOT  RUN
   ERRORFIL  29.err
CO FINISHED

